1147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 498 0 R
/T (Dimensional Change during Sintering Changes in dimensions of metal powder compact can occur during the production process.  The ability to control or predict the changes is an important factor in the fabrication process.  The metal powder used, as well as various processing parameters determine  whether  there  will  be  shrinkage,  growth  or  no-net  change  in  dimensions  in  the finished metal powder compacts.  The size change, expressed as a % is defined as the linear difference between the die size and the size of the sintered part after cooling to room temperature.  Occasionally, the size change is also expressed as the difference between the green part size and the size of the sintered, cold P/M part)
/E (Dimensional Change during Sintering Changes in dimensions of metal powder compact can occur during the production process.  The ability to control or predict the changes is an important factor in the fabrication process.  The metal powder used, as well as various processing parameters determine  whether  there  will  be  shrinkage,  growth  or  no-net  change  in  dimensions  in  the finished metal powder compacts.  The size change, expressed as a % is defined as the linear difference between the die size and the size of the sintered part after cooling to room temperature.  Occasionally, the size change is also expressed as the difference between the green part size and the size of the sintered, cold P/M part)
/Pg 95 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
